{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_01DdFVhuscD8qMQG5tDLWz81","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## runtime-host — Build Trio Session Summary\n\nGrounded in the two member documents (`skills/gandalf/planning/runtime-host/foreman.config.json` + `EXECUTION-LOG.md`) and the frozen plan/journal they reference.\n\n**What the session built**\n- Shipped the **missing Tier-1 deterministic runtime host** for the already-shipped Gandalf v1 skill — the \"thin runtime entry\" that journal/0001 had left as an open follow-up.\n- Three additive artifacts, no forking of the engine: `runtime/seam-pass.mjs` (pure `applySeamPass(rawDraft, {cross_model})` composer), `runtime/gandalf-run.mjs` (the real CLI), and `runtime/RAW-DRAFT-CONTRACT.md` (what the model emits in runtime mode).\n\n**Foreman config / gate discipline** (`foreman.config.json`)\n- Project `gandalf-runtime-host`; docs trio = DESCRIPTION / IMPLEMENTATION-PLAN / EXECUTION-LOG; `cwd: ../..`; **`git: false`** (Foreman did not commit — commits were done by hand afterward).\n- Ground-truth gate = `node --test test/*.test.mjs`, deterministic; the live-refuter `agent()` dispatch is explicitly **out of scope and out of the gate**.\n\n**Pre-build state** (Execution Log seed)\n- Seeded by Crucible Stage 2 (2026-06-22); the log is **empty below the seed** — Foreman appended no per-wave EXECUTE→GATE→REVIEW→FIX entries to this file.\n- Baseline declared: Gandalf v1 shipped, **130/130** canary tests, to be re-verified at build start.\n- Substrate single-family (`cross_model:false`); HALT-worthy = any change to shipped seams/schema/canary or reaching for the `agent()` live-refuter seam.\n\n**Why it was needed**\n- The first real run proved the model produces good DIAGNOSE/SITUATE/ANTICIPATE *content* but, as pure SKILL.md prose, keeps hand-approximating tier stamps and failing B-honesty three ways. Root cause: honest tiers + stamps are the **seam's deterministic job, not the model's**. The host is that wiring — output is canary-conformant **by construction**.\n\n**Plan shape** (3 waves, each holds/grows test count, 130 stays green)\n- Wave 1: the pure `applySeamPass` composer (diagnose→provenance stamp, anticipate→compose, situate→compose; only REFUTED drops; per-item `degraded` rolls up to top-level per B6; malformed draft throws named `SeamPassInputError`).\n- Wave 2: the CLI entry (`--input`/stdin → seam-pass → `assertIncrement1Conformant` → `--output`/stdout; malformed input or failed assertion ⇒ non-zero exit, honest stderr, **nothing written**) + the raw-draft contract.\n- Wave 3: integration test + docs (SKILL.md §RUNTIME repointed from aspiration to the real host; LESSONS + journal/0002 record the landing).\n\n**Scope boundary (by design)**\n- Tier-1 = ONE model run + deterministic seam pass. Every elevation honestly lands at **SPECULATIVE** with `NO_INDEPENDENT_REFUTATION_STAMP`; diagnosis keeps its evidence rung + `gandalf_core`; `risk_labels` cap at single-family **PROMISING**; only REFUTED drops.\n- The **live-refuter PROMISING tier** (real named-defeater dispatch + researchPrime SITUATE commission) needs the `agent()` seam and is a sequenced **follow-on, not in this effort**.\n\n**Result**\n- `node --test test/*.test.mjs` **GREEN**: the 130 canary tests held (host is additive, reimplements no grading logic) plus the new `runtime-seam-pass` / `runtime-entry` / `runtime-integration` tests. No drift; single-family PROMISING ceiling and SPECULATIVE refutation floor applied by the seams, not the host.\n\n**Caveat on grounding:** the Execution Log itself records only the pre-build seed — the per-wave build narrative and GREEN verdict above are grounded in the frozen DESCRIPTION/IMPLEMENTATION-PLAN and journal/0002 (the build entry), not in Foreman-appended log lines. Post-build commits on this branch (`lenient input / strict output`, `sanitize out-of-enum values`) indicate hardening beyond the member-document scope."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":131,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6604,"cache_read_input_tokens":31390,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":6604},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"549832a8-8582-4358-912d-15a5b08fb91d","uuid":"9a4945b4-246d-4409-b356-7985ec1520b7","request_id":"req_011CcLjkSiSb8VMvxkvwJAdQ"}
